<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Welcome to Rea</title>
    <style>
      body {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        background: #ffffff;
        font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      }

      .container {
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 600px;
        margin: auto;
        background: #ffffff;
      }

      .header {
        background: #7d52f41a;
        padding: 40px 20px 20px;
        text-align: left;
      }

      .logo img {
        height: 40px;
      }

      .hero-circle {
        width: 120px;
        float: right;
        margin-top: -60px;
      }

      .content {
        padding: 30px 20px;
        color: #5c5c5c;
        font-size: 16px;
        line-height: 24px;
      }

      .highlight-box {
        background: #7d52f41a;
        border-left: 4px solid #7d52f4;
        padding: 12px 16px;
        margin: 20px 0;
        font-weight: bold;
        color: #7d52f4;
      }

      .footer {
        background: #f7f7f7;
        text-align: center;
        padding: 20px 16px;
        font-size: 14px;
        color: #a3a3a3;
        line-height: 20px;
      }

      a.unsubscribe {
        color: #5c5c5c;
        text-decoration: underline;
      }

      @media screen and (max-width: 480px) {
        .hero-circle {
          display: none;
        }
        .header {
          text-align: center;
          padding-top: 30px;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>

  <body>
    <table class="container" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
      <!-- HEADER -->
      <tr>
        <td class="header">
          <div class="logo">
            <!-- <img src="cid:rea-logo" alt="Rea Logo" /> -->
          </div>
          <img src="cid:rea-logo" class="hero-circle" alt="" />
        </td>
      </tr>

      <!-- BODY -->
      <tr>
        <td class="content">
          <p>Hi {{ name }},</p>

          <p>Thank you for joining the waitlist for Rea.</p>

          <div class="highlight-box">
            We're exploring a simple idea:<br />
            What if the Bible could talk back?
          </div>

          <p>
            Rea is being built to help you reflect, ask questions, and grow
            closer to God through gentle, Scripture-filled conversations.
            You'll be among the first to experience it.
          </p>

          <p>
            Thank you for being part of this journey with us.<br />
            We can't wait to share more with you soon.
          </p>

          <p>With gratitude,<br />The Rea Team</p>
        </td>
      </tr>

      <!-- FOOTER -->
      <tr>
        <td class="footer">
          If you ever wish to step off this journey, you can
          <a href="#" class="unsubscribe">unsubscribe</a> anytime.
          <br /><br />
          © {{ copyRightYear }} Rea
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </body>
</html>
